// A concat churn that RETAINS NOTHING: 200k iterations, each building a fresh
// 37-char string and dropping it on the next assignment. Under an address-space
// cap this separates a backend that reclaims (min seed builder plus assignment
// free, gen2/native mark and sweep) from one that only grows.
hold i = 0
while i < 200000 {
  hold t = concat("aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa", "b")
  hold i = i + 1
}
show i
